        "value": "There is a small chance that injuries and danger to life could occur from large waves and beach material being thrown onto sea fronts, coastal roads and properties",
        "valueName": "impacts"
       },
       {
        "value": "There is a slight chance of some damage to buildings, such as tiles blown from roofs, as well as damage to trees",
        "valueName": "impacts"
